Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:59.08,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,解ってる　只　バグってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:01.77,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,螺子(ねじ)が飛んでる　莫迦(ばか)げた配役(キャスティング)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:03.88,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,奔ってる　何故か　ランブル
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:06.80,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,これじゃ　まるでハムスター
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.78,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,「逆境」「絶望」具現化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:11.58,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,自分勝手な　エコーチェンバーじゃ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.79,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,「逆転」「信用」無力か！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:16.48,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,たぶん乗り切れない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:21.33,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,嗤う　マジョリティーの　御事情　知らんけど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:26.34,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,秘める　マイノリティーの　正義(エゴ)を　舐めんなよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.69,0:02:28.45,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,「さーあっ」イッツ　ショータイム
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:32.11,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,冗談じゃない　別に見世物でもない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:36.98,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,不器用だって　炎上したって　ニンゲンしてんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:39.37,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,底辺から　はじめるんなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:41.84,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,アガる以外　択ぶ余地ない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:46.74,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,敗ける為の　人生(ゲーム)だなんて　誰もしねえよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:48.94,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,乱舞　ランブル rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.65,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,キミを救い出せるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.65,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,ボクは主役(ヒーロー)じゃなくていい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:59.06,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,そう　死ぬ気で生きていく　確証論
Comment: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:59.08,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}我了解 這只是出了BUG
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:01.77,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}螺絲鬆了　愚蠢至極的角色分配
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:03.88,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}一路狂奔　卻是一團混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:06.80,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}這簡直　就像是倉鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.78,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}「逆境」「絶望」具現化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:11.58,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}我行我素的　同温層
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.79,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}「逆轉」「信用」毫無力量！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:16.48,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}可能熬不過這一關
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:21.33,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}嘲笑多數派的處境　我是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:26.34,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}膽敢嘲笑少數派的正義
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.69,0:02:28.45,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}「來」　 It's Showtime
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:32.11,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}少開玩笑了　我又不是什麼觀賞用的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:36.98,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}就算笨手笨脚　就算炎上　我還是在瘋狂地「當人」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:39.37,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}既然從底邊開始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:41.84,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}也就只能往上爬了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:46.74,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}為了輸掉　這種人生遊戲　誰都不會想玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:48.94,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}亂舞　混亂 rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.65,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}如果是為了拯救
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.65,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}我不是主角英雄也無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:59.06,OPJPCH,,0,0,0,,{\an2}沒錯　這就是我搏命活下去的　確証論
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:45.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,アーユーハッピー？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.25,0:22:48.09,EDJP,,0,0,0,,今宵も　どうぞ　ご覧になって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.09,0:22:51.89,EDJP,,0,0,0,,欺瞞と虚構で飾ったショウタイム
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:53.73,EDJP,,0,0,0,,楽しいとこばっか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:55.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,切り取ったらグッドデイ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.85,0:22:59.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,未公開シーンは負の思い出ね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:01.14,EDJP,,0,0,0,,記憶のフィルム懲りずに覗けば
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.14,0:23:03.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,まるで瓦礫の山です　キリがない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:05.10,EDJP,,0,0,0,,悩み苦しむほど時間は無いし
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.10,0:23:06.52,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ワガママに行こうじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.52,0:23:07.53,EDJP,,0,0,0,,(変わりたい)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:09.17,EDJP,,0,0,0,,すべては自分次第だと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.17,0:23:10.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,,理解してるはずだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.69,0:23:12.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,迫るプレッシャー　さらにプレッシャー
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:14.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,一時停止ボタンはどこですか？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:18.53,EDJP,,0,0,0,,涙の色に染まる後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.53,0:23:22.31,EDJP,,0,0,0,,これからもどうぞ　よろしくね
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.31,0:23:26.17,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ただ前を向いて　歪んだ希望を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.17,0:23:29.29,EDJP,,0,0,0,,胸に秘めて　生きるだけよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:30.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,,理想⇔現実の差異に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.85,0:23:33.21,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ずっと今日も最低なフィーリング
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.21,0:23:36.97,EDJP,,0,0,0,,でも「不可能」言えないのが自分
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.97,0:23:38.43,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ハロー　混沌　世界は
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.43,0:23:40.74,EDJP,,0,0,0,,きっとそうだ　当然のように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.74,0:23:44.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,願う　淡い未来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:46.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ハッピーめいたパンドラ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.61,0:23:48.34,EDJP,,0,0,0,,開いて最高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.77,0:23:52.34,EDJP,,0,0,0,,想定外の勇気で偉大な第一歩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:54.86,EDJP,,0,0,0,,何回だって変化のショウタイム
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你快樂嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.25,0:22:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚也請盡情觀賞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.09,0:22:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這是一場用欺騙與虛假妝點的表演時間
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,只挑快樂的片段
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,拼貼起來就是美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.85,0:22:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那些未公開的片段才是真正的陰影回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.35,0:23:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,若還不死心地窺看記憶膠捲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.14,0:23:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,映入眼簾的只是堆積如山的瓦礫　無窮無盡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但也沒空去煩惱和痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.10,0:23:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,乾脆隨心所欲地走下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.52,0:23:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,(我想改變)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.53,0:23:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都取決於自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.17,0:23:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,明明能理解這一點
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.69,0:23:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,卻仍然面對壓力　再疊上壓力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,暫停鍵到底在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,染上淚水顏色的後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.53,0:23:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,今後還請你多多指教呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.31,0:23:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只會繼續向前　將扭曲的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.17,0:23:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,深藏在心裡　繼續活下去罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,理想⇔現實的差異
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.85,0:23:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也依然是糟透的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.21,0:23:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但就是無法對自己說「不可能」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.97,0:23:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哈囉　混沌　這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.43,0:23:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一定就是這樣　理所當然地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.74,0:23:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,依然懷抱那朦朧的未來願望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.93,0:23:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,像是披著幸福假象的潘朵拉盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.61,0:23:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,打開就迎來最高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.77,0:23:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,憑藉意想不到的勇氣邁出偉大的第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,無論多少次　都是變化的登場時刻
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.09,0:00:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,據說人類對恐怖的記憶會比愉快的記憶記得更牢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,這似乎稱作「戰略性資訊處理」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此 余完全無法領會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,乖 乖 乖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你又在看那種奇怪的自我啟發書籍了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.99,0:00:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,別怪我 是我這個新身體渴望這些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是個愛現一族呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 我聽說了 瑛太那傢伙又幹了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他用點數殺了一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一個曾經霸凌過他的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 好奇怪 你說「殺了」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他有那麼多點數嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 這麼說來…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一點也沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他用點數頂多只能讓受害者遇上車禍而已
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不過我得說…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他當時的表現確實可圈可點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以最後是他親手解決掉的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那更帥了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 時間到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,各位引頸期盼的時刻來臨了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,由我親自設計的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,攝影機開拍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,三…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,二…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(438,1)\fs90\c&HF5EF10&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4.5}逃{\c&Hff3cfe&}出{\c&H851078&\3c&H8DE4EF&}逆轉飯店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這…是什麼地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我們在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,先是學校…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,現在是飯店？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎 可悲的人類們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.07,0:03:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,今天為你們準備的是真實密室逃脫遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,其名為…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「逆轉飯店」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,都到這時候了還裝什麼聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,營造氣氛很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,又沒有觀眾在看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想感受一下那種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.34,0:03:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 我我我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我超喜歡密室逃脫的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你在高興什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,各位好 我是你們的嚮導 滴答人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 你們有六十分鐘的時間同心協力…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.78,0:04:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,總之逃出去就好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 不准破壞場景
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 要解開謎題才能逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你這個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就照他們說的啊 要遵守規則才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是站哪邊的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,謎題是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,又是他們那種無聊的「玩笑」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,時間有限 我們快開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想因為一個玩笑而死
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,總之 我們先分頭尋找線索吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,說得對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.82,0:04:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要攻略密室逃脫 團隊合作是不可或缺的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你的表情好像在說信不過我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎麼可能信得過會殺害同伴的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,說得好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到下個遊戲竟然是需要合作的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,對我真是不利啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我會負責監視瑛太同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,慧小姐你要監視他？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你就沒想過她可能跟我一樣壞嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不會被你所騙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好、好的 那我們分頭…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他們的情況好像不太樂觀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,才剛開始就內鬨了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我所願
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(517,1)\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(300,72)\fscx197\fscy36}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.98,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(602,168)}馬上就找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(517,1)\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1314,67.5)\fscx105\fscy38}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.98,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1470,160)}真快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼明顯的地方放了支螺絲起子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,看來是要用在哪裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 可以請教一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我是您的粉絲…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我從您身上學到很多時尚的訣竅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,現在是說這個的時候嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.97,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有件事我一直很想問…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,您為什麼會參加這個遊戲？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,區區十萬圓 您應該不會缺到這種地步吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs30\c&H3B3C4D&\pos(811.8,304.5)}【重要】 恭喜您中獎了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs48\an9\bord4.5\c&H646EC2&\3c&H37323C&\pos(1224,432)}恭喜您\N{\fs66}獲得\N{\c&H76F1E5&\fs48}十萬圓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我以為當紅女演員不會理這種…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:07:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(300,72)\fscx139\fscy34}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.14,0:07:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(510,170)}真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:07:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\fscx129\fscy34\pos(1245,78)}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.14,0:07:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1444,170)}你別裝蒜了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在不像以前那樣有電視通告了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,為了不被世人遺忘 我什麼都得做 拍影片也行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,既然是我的粉絲 你應該知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我媽被靈媒師詐騙 欠了一大筆債
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.51,0:07:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我姊為了買能量石而破產
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.68,0:07:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸則是因為靈性按摩而破產
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我必須重返電視圈 賺大錢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.73,0:07:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以八卦雜誌寫的都是真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,家人毀了我的人生 只會扯我後腿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,家人…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能不信 但這對我來說反而是個機會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(300,72)\fscx215\fscy36}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.60,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(626,168)}突然開始講悲慘身世w
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1188,67.5)\fscx147\fscy36}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.60,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1405,166)}反而是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,只要一切順利 我就可以用惡魔的力量來還清債務
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.57,0:07:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,重返明星之路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可是這攸關性命耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是為了增加觀看數吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.51,0:08:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想…我也是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(750,1738,\alpha&H00&)\fs60\bord6\an9\c&H808385&\3c&HF2F8F6&}在不被任何人\N發現的情況下\N把所有畫扶正\N{\alpha&HFF&\t(28,404,\alpha&H00&)}+２０萬點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看來你找到特殊卡片了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要完成卡片上寫的任務 就能獲得獎勵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.59,0:08:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要做、何時做 都由你決定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\bord7.5\an7\c&H808385&\3c&HF2F8F6&}對另一名\N玩家的提問\N說謊回答\N+１０萬點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\bord7.5\an9\c&H808385&\3c&HF2F8F6&}讓任意數量的\N玩家發生爭執\N通關獎勵２倍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.31,0:08:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,「對另一名玩家的提問說謊回答 +10萬點」？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(300,72)\fscx220\fscy36}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.83,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(630,166)}啊 她們互相給對方看了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\fscx200\fscy36\pos(1029,78)}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.83,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1333,170)}這遊戲還玩得下去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這擺明了就是要我們內鬨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我還以為這是合作遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這是陷阱 我們都別理它
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 大家都把自己找到的線索分享出來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(295.5,72)\fscx157\fscy35}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.76,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,160)}鋼鐵般的精神力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1312.5,81)\fscx104\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.76,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1468,168)}我喜歡她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我檢查過瑛太同學的所有東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託 就相信我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\bord6\an9\c&H414645&\3c&HF2F8F6&\pos(1845,54)}提防黃衣之王的風\N那風將奪走你性命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,「提防黃衣之王的風 那風將奪走你性命」？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我們沒時間浪費了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只要解開這個問答或謎題就好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(295.5,72)\fscx78\fscy33}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.95,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(406,160)}剩30分
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1312.5,81)\fscx104\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.95,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1472,162)}時鐘看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣真的對嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(22,2190,\fscx107.42\fscy107.42)\blur0.6\fs54\fnNoto Sans TC Black\fax-0.4\fry180\frz23.89\move(784.5,567,772.62,568.92,22,2190)}逆轉飯店
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到鑰匙了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,腦充血了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1141.5,85.5)\fscx161\fscy38}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.56,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1383,170)}就說看不懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(295.5,72)\fscx90\fscy33}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.57,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,162)}剩15分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,趕上了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.03,0:09:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就能逃出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你們該不會以為只要離開那個房間就算通關了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.35,0:10:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不過謝謝你們 讓節目更有戲劇性了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的「逃出逆轉飯店」現在才要開始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,少開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,果然不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我們找遍了整個飯店 卻沒找到任何出口
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(295.5,72)\fscx52\fscy38}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.33,0:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(376,156)}可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1123.5,79.5)\fscx169\fscy38}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.33,0:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1380,162)}我的飯店超讚的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.05,0:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,連窗戶都沒有 根本看不到外面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我們非得解決這個不可嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,「讓一名祭品站上去並按下開關 即可完成儀式」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:11:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,「祭品將被淘汰 但你們面前的門將會開啟」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,祭品…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想祭品站上去的地方 應該就是這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(297,72)\fscx180\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.45,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,162)}死亡遊戲裡的老梗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1083,67.5)\fscx182\fscy38}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.45,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1360.5,162)}雖然老梗但很好用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一般來說 「選出祭品」只是遊戲的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但這可是真正的邪神們辦的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但為了通關 我們還是得獻上祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那你去當祭品好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.11,0:11:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這是兩回事 我可不⋯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想當祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,誰想當啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩十分鐘了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,隨便誰都好 快點去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我來當祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要自願？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我的贖罪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(295.5,72)\fscx76\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.32,0:12:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(415,166)}食材？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1371,73.5)\fscx86\fscy34}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.32,0:12:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1498,162)}差得遠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,苦果？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你們知道去年發生的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.66,0:12:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我實驗室的助理失蹤了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那天 我和助理走在山路上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,為了尋找一個有名的鬧鬼地點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(295.5,72)\fscx76\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.09,0:12:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(420.5,168)}好興奮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1371,73.5)\fscx86\fscy34}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.09,0:12:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1500,164)}心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(297,72)\fscx215\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.31,0:12:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(618.5,164)} 確定裝備沒問題嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\fscx163\fscy38\pos(1134,69)}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.31,0:12:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1379,170)}沒問題 一切都好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,當然 我們是去揭穿騙局的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(297,72)\fscx138\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.48,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,166)}沒人看到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1137,73.5)\fscx165\fscy34}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.48,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1381,168)}要逃就趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.77,0:12:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,結果…我害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(297,72)\fscx138\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.66,0:12:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(506,158)}不能逃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1204.5,78)\fscx141\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.66,0:12:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1413,168)}不可以逃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是說你為了避免麻煩就丟下他了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 你真是個爛人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才同意參加遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,邪神的遊戲力量是真實的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我告訴自己可以用點數讓他復活
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但你死了也救不了他吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我意識到就算我讓他復活也改變不了我殺了他的事實
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我無法抹去這份罪惡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我寧願幫助你們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這一定是神給我的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(297,72)\fscx183\fscy42}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.62,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(559,154)}他有點愛現
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1084.5,75)\fscx180\fscy34}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.62,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1352,168)}真不愧是神秘學家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一個贖清過去罪孽的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧 按下按鈕 誰都行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我來按
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.95,0:13:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,鶫小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,再這樣耗下去 我們都會完蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我按了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,按吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 不該是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(297,72)\fscx146\fscy32}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.23,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(521.5,166)}呀哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1272,82.5)\fscx117\fscy30}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.23,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1453,162)}太好笑了www
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,開了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,鶫小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,環奈 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 我第一個出去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,鶫小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不 為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,環奈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.98,0:14:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼好笑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一對笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,連這麼重要的事都沒發現
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是「逆轉飯店」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是相反的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以理所當然 訊息的意思也要反過來看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果說需要祭品 那就是不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,如果說那是終點 那就是相反
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,玩遊戲前要先搞懂規則
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,玩密室逃脫的連這都不懂嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可、可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那鷹城副教授…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,白死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你明明知道 卻放任事情發生？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,誰管他們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那兩個人也想犧牲我們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「若你成為祭品 你將通關遊戲 而其他人則會死亡」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是特殊卡片之一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那大叔從頭到尾都想害我們？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果你能親手淘汰某人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.23,0:15:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,並在其他人之前逃脫 就能獲得獎勵」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,現在懂了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他們不過是只顧自己的下三濫罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,鶫小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯 月詠鶫只在乎救她自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,每個人都有自己的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是是是 隨便你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你那套乖寶寶理論我聽膩了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,結果你跟其他人也沒試著阻止他們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我說錯了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是任何人的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,鶫小姐用的那扇門是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那真正的出口在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道答案吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然不想承認 但我也有點慌了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我們得解開謎題
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,環奈小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,思考 思考 思考
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:16:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我們漏了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.57,0:17:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,逆轉飯店…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是相反的飯店
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一切…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.28,0:17:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果一切真的都是相反的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(297,72)\fscx137\fscy35}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.76,0:17:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs96\fnNoto Sans TC Black\c&H282B28&\pos(501,78)}情勢逆轉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(901.5,64.5)\fscx242\fscy38}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.76,0:17:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs96\fnNoto Sans TC Black\c&H282B28&\pos(1269,78)}千萬不要轉台
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那地板和天花板也是相反的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,別管那個了 房間在下沉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,停了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有兩扇終點門？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.54,0:17:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.73,0:17:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要我們選一扇嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,門上的浮雕…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,藍色的是「水之克蘇魯」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,紅色的是「炎之古亞」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,地板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,得快點選一扇門
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.43,0:17:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一扇才是對的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有線索
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的卡片一定有提示
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.01,0:17:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,對喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是風會帶來什麼的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\bord6\an9\c&H414645&\3c&HF2F8F6&\pos(1845,54)}提防黃衣之王的風\N那風將奪走你性命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,「提防黃衣之王的風 那風將奪走你性命」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊的浮雕有微弱的風吹出來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,既然一切都是相反的 那卡片的意思也是相反的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說 我們眼前的兩扇門都是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的出口是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.99,0:18:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那個洞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(300,72)\fscx220\fscy36}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.70,0:18:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(627,168)}人生是一連串的選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\blur1.5\p1\c&HF6F9F8&\pos(1083,72)\fscx178\fscy33}m 0 0 l 300 0 300 300 0 300
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.70,0:18:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,162)}三思而後行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要跳進去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.13,0:18:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,要是錯了你要負責嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你確定嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我、我確定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大概…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.49,0:19:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,幹得好 環奈小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽到攝影棚傳來歡呼聲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就知道你答對了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你聽到歡呼聲才跳的？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,小心為上嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是瘋了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,反正通關了就好 不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是沒錯 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你幹嘛把我一起帶下來？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你那麼有自信地推理
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.31,0:19:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,當然要讓你負責啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,各位成功逃出密室逃脫遊戲了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,又活下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.31,0:19:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這次淘汰了兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的玩家每人將獲得一百四十萬點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我本來還希望能再少一點人…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你又動了什麼手腳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.72,0:20:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我什麼也沒做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.71,0:20:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,應該說正因為我什麼都沒做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,鷹城和鶫拿到的特殊獎勵卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\bord7.5\an7\c&H414645&\3c&HF2F8F6&}若你成為祭品\N你將通關遊戲\N而其他人則會死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,其實是我先找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我故意無視了它們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我想說…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,運氣好的話 也許會有其他人上當而被淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你也沒資格生我的氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你們雖然不承認 但其實也很高興吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.81,0:20:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你們活下來了 還能拿到更多點數
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為在這種鬼遊戲裡還能大家一起當好朋友嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我們都是瘋狂的神經病 不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該感謝我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,應該要更高興點才對 你也想要錢吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:20:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那環奈大小姐是為了什麼崇高的理由來這裡的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然希望能再多點犧牲者 但這個結局也很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一般般吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.93,0:21:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 真是嚴格
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 各位 我們下個遊戲再見
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.87,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,祝各位有個美好的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？怎麼了 加塔諾托亞？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是所謂的心痛嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,別理他 他又被奇怪的書影響了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.51,0:21:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我們在做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只是傷害無力的人類 這樣還能自稱宇宙恐怖嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.81,0:22:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,還能自稱外神嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.81,0:22:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你瘋了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.21,0:22:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,下個遊戲輪到你了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.03,0:22:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒問題嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.71,0:22:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我想相信他們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,相信他們的人性
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.45,0:22:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以這將會是我的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.67,0:22:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(233,226)\pos(960,120)\3c&H1F221F&}命運已被改寫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.53,0:22:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fs69\fad(809,1)\c&HBA19EA&\3c&H1F221F&\pos(958,936)}【解謎遊戲】 {\c&HFFFFFF&}歡迎來到\N逆轉飯店 {\c&HBA19EA&}【密室逃脫】
